    "mitigation": "Replace instantaneous reserve-based valuation with a sufficiently long Uniswap V2 cumulative-price TWAP or an independently sourced LP valuation. Require a minimum observation interval, validate pair identity and liquidity, and reject or cap prices that deviate materially from prior observations or an independent reference. Before persisting debt reports, apply conservative deviation limits and consider using delayed or multi-observation prices. Review on-chain RootPriceOracle.tokenMappings and UniswapV2EthOracle.registrations to ensure that no financially sensitive vault asset depends on an unapproved spot-reserve source.",
